041AA4             0200*   
041AA4             0201*   ; VDU 23, 27, 14, x; y;: Move current sprite by x, y pixels
041AA4             0202*   ; USING 16.8 FIXED POINT COORDINATES
041AA4             0203*   ; inputs: ub.c is dx, ud.e is dy
041AA4             0204*   ;   the fractional portiion of the inputs are truncated
041AA4             0205*   ;   leaving only the 16-bit integer portion
